+ * architecture, or THOR_STOCK_LAUNCH_BOUNDS, keeps the stock declarations. */
+/* THOR default: sm_110 (Jetson Thor) builds get the measured-best launch bounds ("s85")
+ * unless THOR_STOCK_LAUNCH_BOUNDS is defined: intersect closest/shadow (64,16) = 64 regs, shade_surface
+ * (384,2) = 80 regs. Open Data +46/+60/+41% (monster/junkshop/classroom); image differences stay at
